s a subset of $A.\\,✓$\n\n- ${{0},{6,9,15}}$ is *not* a subset of $A$ because it contains the element ${0}\\notin A.\\,\\times $\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only\"."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186240973 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054631 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "9b7f1d12-3335-5dd7-bf36-e07077d0c45d" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Subsets of Special Sets"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c158a0f0-c079-589b-b013-4a9f9b82fb3b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461395} {:answer/id #uuid "8744280e-f02c-5bc6-9d15-48facb9c919f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461396}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8744280e-f02c-5bc6-9d15-48facb9c919f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461396} :answer-field/id #uuid "2566b0e9-5b7a-5e81-802e-237820ae4fe6" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462451} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2c6a5137-3745-5393-b21d-8c28530d2fca" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461397} {:answer/id #uuid "65f9100a-2754-5f17-bf7a-2c57cf6cb46d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461398}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "65f9100a-2754-5f17-bf7a-2c57cf6cb46d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461398} :answer-field/id #uuid "31f0cff4-3a12-571f-9bd3-e8a1753421a6" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462452} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fc9c1a65-9169-513c-86d2-a12c5bee7636" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461399} {:answer/id #uuid "f8e6960b-0a97-5423-acd7-79f6befe4c4d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461400}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f8e6960b-0a97-5423-acd7-79f6befe4c4d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461400} :answer-field/id #uuid "0cc0e7a3-af1f-59d7-a52a-6b8ecb9ea699" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462453}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "eb139d93-059f-53af-a8f9-6a747e8ff56b" :question/math-academy-id "q-105034" :question/problem "Which of the following are subsets of $R?$\n- **I.** ${Q}^{-}$ (the set of negative rationals)\n- **II.** ${Z}^{+}$ (the set of positive integers)\n- **III.** $N$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "$A$ is a subset of $B$ if every element of $A$ is an element of $B.$\n\nWith that in mind, let's inspect the given choices.\n\n- ${Q}^{-}$ is  a subset of $R.$ Every negative rational number is a real number.\n\n- ${Z}^{+}$ is a subset of $R.$ Every positive integer number is a real number.\n\n- $N$ a subset of $R.$ Every natural number is a real number.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I, II and III\"."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186395707 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054629 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "b0e5efaa-e624-5045-abdb-cdf8d32ad6cb" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Subsets of a Given Set"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "aaf6ad71-0776-59f5-ae